GPSr: N56° 14.127 W117° 17.405&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We finally arrived in Peace River after a long days visiting caps in central western Alberta.  We were off to dinner after visiting Henry Fuller &quot;12 ft&quot; Davis, when we realized this one was just down the road.  A quick drive up cap that was embedded in the sidewalk on the main street,  Thanks for the cap OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
