?Elevation: 332m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ah, the old cap in the sidewalk on main street in front of bank trick, eh? Actually, this one was quite painless as I didn't feel all that many prying eyes on me as the streets were pretty quiet this morning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;
